  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your touch fills the target with peaceful contemplation.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Touch of Serenity<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using this feat against a non-mythic target, the effect lasts for a number of rounds equal to your mythic rank or tier on a failed save. If you expend one use of your mythic power, you can use this ability as a melee touch attack rather than a melee attack until the end of your turn. You can use this feat more than once per round if you are making multiple attacks, including a flurry of blows.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
